@startuml

[*] --> Registration : entry / Device Handout — Polished Requirement Specification
Registration : do / Collect personal details from donor during registration
Registration : exit / Verify entered personal details after registration

Registration --> ContactInfoVerification : verify / Check the entered personal details after registration
ContactInfoVerification : do / Collect contact information from donor after verifying their personal details
ContactInfoVerification : exit / Verify contact information

ContactInfoVerification --> DeviceDetailsCollection : collect / Allow donors to share details about the device they want to donate
DeviceDetailsCollection : do / Review the shared device details
DeviceDetailsCollection : exit / Accept or inform that it cannot be accepted based on requirements

DeviceDetailsCollection --> DeviceAcceptance : accept / Support if a device meets the requirements, the system shall accept it
DeviceAcceptance : do / Assign an executive to handle the accepted device
DeviceAcceptance : exit / Confirm the status of the accepted device by the executive

DeviceAcceptance --> [*] : Acceptance Confirmation
DeviceRejected --> [*] : Rejection Notification

@enduml
